OL,5,G0600 AFRODEUTSCHE
OL,6,     FIt's one of Sunday's simple
OL,7,     Fpleasures... Let AFRODEUTSCHE's
OL,8,     Fselections gently smooth out the
OL,9,     Fday with music perfect for
OL,10,     Fpeaceful introspection.
OL,11,G0800 Radcliffe and Maconie
OL,12,     FStuart Maconie presents a feast of
OL,13,     Fgreat music and chat for weekend
OL,14,     Fbreakfast.
OL,15,G1000 Cerys Matthews
OL,16,     FCerys welcomes Grammy-nominated
OL,17,     FMalian musician Fatoumata Diawara
OL,18,     Fto perform live and chats to
OL,19,     Flegendary Indian singer Asha
OL,20,     FPuthli.
